# .env is committed on purpose: it holds only the public Supabase URL and publishable key
# that the browser build needs (Lovable builds from this repository). Never put secrets in it.
# Private local values (e.g. SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY) go in .env.local, which stays ignored.
.env.*
!.env.example
